   2:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   * @file    stm32g4xx_hal_flash_ex.c
